        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "牛栏不可建在污沟边，否则定堕牛胎，损子连累。栏后若有行露，主牛必相烂蹄肩。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
