        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "一十黄一十起于坤，二十还归震巽，四十官中归乾盈，此是神仙妙诀根。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
